{"id":"55c39f44acb2211c","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-rewrite-relation.md","title":"df-rewrite-relation","display":"df-rewrite-relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-step]]"],"label":"56-df-rewrite-relation","aliases":["56-df-rewrite-relation"],"display":"df-rewrite-relation","type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-rewrite-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-rewrite-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rewrite-relation"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-rewrite-relation\"><code>df-rewrite-relation</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)\">\\(R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>，一步关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\\subseteq T\\times T\">\\(\\to_R\\subseteq T\\times T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^{\\,0}\\coloneqq\\{(t,t)\\mid t\\in T\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_R^{\\,0}\\coloneqq\\{(t,t)\\mid t\\in T\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^{\\,n+1}\\coloneqq\n\\{(s,t)\\in T\\times T\\mid\\exists u\\in T\\;((s,u)\\in\\to_R^{\\,n}\\land u\\to_R t)\\}\n\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_R^{\\,n+1}\\coloneqq\n\\{(s,t)\\in T\\times T\\mid\\exists u\\in T\\;((s,u)\\in\\to_R^{\\,n}\\land u\\to_R t)\\}\n\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^{*}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\to_R^{\\,n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_R^{*}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\to_R^{\\,n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\to_R^{*}t\\iff(s,t)\\in\\to_R^{*}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\to_R^{*}t\\iff(s,t)\\in\\to_R^{*}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow_R\\;\\coloneqq\\to_R\\cup(\\to_R)^{-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\leftrightarrow_R\\;\\coloneqq\\to_R\\cup(\\to_R)^{-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow_R^{*}\\coloneqq\n\\{(s,t)\\in T\\times T\\mid\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists a:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to T\\;\n(a(0)=s\\land a(n)=t\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;((a(i),a(i+1))\\in\\leftrightarrow_R))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\leftrightarrow_R^{*}\\coloneqq\n\\{(s,t)\\in T\\times T\\mid\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists a:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to T\\;\n(a(0)=s\\land a(n)=t\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;((a(i),a(i+1))\\in\\leftrightarrow_R))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\leftrightarrow_R^{*}t\\iff(s,t)\\in\\leftrightarrow_R^{*}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\leftrightarrow_R^{*}t\\iff(s,t)\\in\\leftrightarrow_R^{*}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>星号表示允许零步的自反传递闭包；双向星号表示可转换性。这里明确构造有限路径，避免将缺括号的排版误读为 R 的幂。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，记号1.1.3及§2.3，印刷第8、38页，OCR页块29、59。本次据用户提供的本地 DjVu 文字层核对陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-rewrite-relation","text":"`df-rewrite-relation`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，一步关系 $\\to_R\\subseteq T\\times T$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-step]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_R\\subseteq T\\times T","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_R^{\\,0}\\coloneqq\\{(t,t)\\mid t\\in T\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\to_R^{\\,n+1}\\coloneqq\n\\{(s,t)\\in T\\times T\\mid\\exists u\\in T\\;((s,u)\\in\\to_R^{\\,n}\\land u\\to_R t)\\}\n\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\to_R^{*}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\to_R^{\\,n}.","display":true},{"tex":"s\\to_R^{*}t\\iff(s,t)\\in\\to_R^{*}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow_R\\;\\coloneqq\\to_R\\cup(\\to_R)^{-1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow_R^{*}\\coloneqq\n\\{(s,t)\\in T\\times T\\mid\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists a:\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\to T\\;\n(a(0)=s\\land a(n)=t\\land\\forall i<n\\;((a(i),a(i+1))\\in\\leftrightarrow_R))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"s\\leftrightarrow_R^{*}t\\iff(s,t)\\in\\leftrightarrow_R^{*}.","display":true}],"bytes":1419,"backlinks":[{"id":"eeba89fe0c30bd6e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 和规则集 $R$ 满足 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-rewrite-system]]；这里 $F,V$ 分别实例化上游的 $\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V$；$\\to_R$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]]。"},{"id":"ebb018d2e72663e2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一步关系和自反传递闭包分别见 [[56-df-rewrite-step]]、[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]。"},{"id":"2ebc9e1638fe6861","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 和规则集 $R$ 满足 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-rewrite-system]]；这里 $F,V$ 分别实例化上游的 $\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V$；$\\to_R$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]]。"},{"id":"f6bf69669f54adda","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0ec3908763541719","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，关系幂 $\\to_R^{\\,n}$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-relation]]。"},{"id":"bd57a306fd3547e4","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$V$ 为与函数符号集不交的可数无限变量集，$x\\in V$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 见 [[56-df-terms]]。重写、策略、左正规性与函数迭代见 [